e=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">3.作者对姐姐的回忆属于哪种叙述方式？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br/></p>", "exerId": 465143, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "阅读题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考专升本大学语文真题", "pracTimesAmount": 157, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "作者对姐姐的回忆属于哪种叙述方式？", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 465143, "umcId": 13559163, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 35}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "表达了诗人对光明未来的深情呼唤和抗战胜利的坚定信念。春天和凝冰两个意象。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 6, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 465144, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "阅读题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考专升本大学语文真题", "pracTimesAmount": 156, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "阅读戴望舒《偶成》，然后回答36~39小题。\n如果生命的春天重到，\n古旧的凝冰都哗哗地解冻，\n那时我会再看见灿烂的微笑，\n再听见明朗的呼唤一这些迢遥的梦。\n这些好东西都决不会消失，\n因为一切好东西都永远存在，\n它们只是像冰一样凝结，\n而有一天会像花一样重开。\n1945年5月31日\n这首写于1945年5月31日的诗，表达了诗人怎样的信念？最能表达这种信念的是哪两个意象？\n", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 465144, "umcId": 13559163, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 36}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "好东西指的是美好的愿望和渴望，这句诗的深刻寓意是中华民族的美好愿望和生命力只是暂时因专制暴政而被室息冻结，但是它们永远都在。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 6, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 465145, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "阅读题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考专升本大学语文真题", "pracTimesAmount": 156, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 4, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 4, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "阅读戴望舒《偶成》，然后回答36~39小题。\n如果生命的春天重到，\n古旧的凝冰都哗哗地解冻，\n那时我会再看见灿烂的微笑，\n再听见明朗的呼唤一这些迢遥的梦。\n这些好东西都决不会消失，\n因为一切好东西都永远存在，\n它们只是像冰一样凝结，\n而有一天会像花一样重开。\n1945年5月31日\n请说明“一切好东西都永远存在，它们只是像冰样凝结”的深刻寓意。 ", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 465145, "umcId": 13559163, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 37}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "象征。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 5, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 465146, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "阅读题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考专升本大学语文真题", "pracTimesAmount": 156, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 2, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 2, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "阅读戴望舒《偶成》，然后回答36~39小题。\n如果生命的春天重到，\n古旧的凝冰都哗哗地解冻，\n那时我会再看见灿烂的微笑，\n再听见明朗的呼唤一这些迢遥的梦。\n这些好东西都决不会消失，\n因为一切好东西都永远存在，\n它们只是像冰一样凝结，\n而有一天会像花一样重开。\n1945年5月31日\n这首诗基本的表现手法是什么？", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 465146, "umcId": 13559163, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 38}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "略", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 3, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 465147, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "作文题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考专升本大学语文真题", "pracTimesAmount": 157, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 50, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 50, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "阅读下面的文字，根据要求作文。\n老子在《道德经》中说：“图难于其易，为大于其细。天下难事，必作于易；天下大事，必作于细。”意思是说谋划难事大事，要从易处和小处考虑。天下的难事，都是先从容易的地方做起；天下的大事，都是从细微的小事做起。\n请根据上述材料，自己确立题目和角度，写一篇以议论为主的文章，字数不少于800字。\n", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 465147, "umcId": 13559163, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 39}], "SimExamStore": {"ExerNum": 39, "CourseId": "H012101", "ExamTime": 120, "ExerSortType": 1, "ScoringMethod": 1, "TotalScore": 150, "SimType": "历年真题", "ExamName": "2018年成考专升本大学语文真题"}, "simId": 5212}